/chaosrack
# The old name of the binary. It was tracked before the rename and the rename
# carried it along, so a 37 MB ELF executable sat in the tree — and in every
# clone — for no reason.
/wasm-stuff

# cmd/stlgen's output. Thirty-odd megabytes of generated geometry that any
# checkout can rebuild in a few seconds — and that the app does not need,
# since it generates the same models in the browser.
/docs/stl/

# Subagent worktrees — separate checkouts, never part of this tree.
.claude/worktrees/
